        <p>There have been three mid week matches. Runcorn pave Broughton a hard game in Manchester on Wedcsday an,' were only beaten 5-4. St. Helens entertained the Kangaroos in miserable weather and were the second team to nil the tourists. The score was three tries to nothing. On Thursday Wigan took their full team to ‘''idnes and only judt scrambled home. Each side had five points at half time, but Levtliam landed a couple of goals after the interval and the League Leaders won 9-5.</p>
