        <head>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>THE tiORTHERN UNION.</p>
        <p>G. T. P. G. T. P. *Broughton II 4 2 11 Australians</p>
        <p>THE NORTHERN RUGBY LEAGUE.</p>
        <p>*lTunslet *Huddersfield 3 6 24 Leeds 0 0 0 *St. llelens. *Dewsbury 2 7 25 Treherbert 0 0 0 *Warrington Salford 2 2 10 *Wakefield T. ... 2 1 7 Hull Kingston R 1 1 3 *Keighley Wi,gan *Runcorn . 2 2 10 Batley *Bradford Rochdale Hornets 1 4 14 *Leigh Oldham 2 3 13 *Widnes 0 0 01 Ebbw 'Vale</p>
